        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108879845?u=eeb9306682180ab80521c80fd8f46609fe3c6770&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The output of the <code class=\"notranslate\">update-browser-releases</code> script is:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">@mdn/browser-compat-data@7.2.1 update-browser-releases<br>\ntsx scripts/update-browser-releases/index.ts --all</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rate limited for commit 014cad89f528483e3fc431ff5ca6e2095d92e7bd. Waiting 165 seconds...</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for Edge for Desktop</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New status for edge 144: nightly, previously beta.</li>\n<li>New status for edge 144: beta, previously nightly.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for Safari for Desktop</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New status for safari 26.1: retired, previously current.</li>\n<li>New status for safari 26.2: current, previously beta.</li>\n<li>New release date for safari 26.2: 2025-12-12, previously undefined.</li>\n<li>New engine version for safari 26.2: 623.1.14, previously 623.1.12.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for Safari for iOS</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New status for safari_ios 26.1: retired, previously current.</li>\n<li>New status for safari_ios 26.2: current, previously beta.</li>\n<li>New release date for safari_ios 26.2: 2025-12-12, previously undefined.</li>\n<li>New engine version for safari_ios 26.2: 623.1.14, previously 623.1.12.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for WKWebView for iOS</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New status for webview_ios 26.1: retired, previously current.</li>\n<li>New status for webview_ios 26.2: current, previously beta.</li>\n<li>New release date for webview_ios 26.2: 2025-12-12, previously undefined.</li>\n<li>New engine version for webview_ios 26.2: 623.1.14, previously 623.1.12.</li>\n</ul>",
